  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Media Trips -EU and Serbia</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The purpose of this contract is to assist and support the EU Delegation in Serbia in successfully organising mainly individual or group tailor-made media trips for Serbian media to EU Member States, international organisations or other countries and regions in the Western Balkans. These trips are mainly geared towards journalists from Serbia but can also include other important multipliers like academics, students and social media influencers (see also under target groups).</narrative>
  </description>
